Brute Force Detection (BFD) v2.0.1
    (C) 1999-2026, R-fx Networks <proj@rfxn.com>
    (C) 2026, Ryan MacDonald <ryan@rfxn.com>
    Licensed under GNU GPL v2 — see COPYING.GPL for details

Log-based brute force attack detection and IP banning for Linux servers —
modular rule engine, sliding time-window counting, automatic ban lifecycle,
and IPv4/IPv6 support.

